No home comforts this weekend. Leamington RFC are on the road across all senior sections.

Friday night: the Vets head to Stratford for a tournament with Evesham and Stratford. The Colts travel to Kenilworth for a friendly.
Saturday: the 1st XV make the trip to Solihull to take on Camp Hill.
Sunday: the Women’s squad join forces with Oadby Wyggs to face Northampton Casuals - hosted by Daventry. 

Good luck to all our sides this weekend. Get out there and enjoy it. 🏉

